title: Memphis Group
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

Design collective started in Milan in 1981 around [[Ettore Sottsass]].

Loud color, odd shapes, cheap laminate, and jokes at modernism's expense.

Members included [[Michele De Lucchi]] ([[First Chair]]) and [[Peter Shire]] ([[Bel Air Chair]]).

